&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;8 Refuse Storage&lt;/u&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;

&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Notwithstanding the details submitted with the application,
prior to above ground works, full details of refuse storage shall be submitted
to and approved in writing by the local planning authority. Prior to
occupation, the approved details shall be fully implemented. Thereafter, the
refuse storage shall be permanently retained.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
